-1.  **Extended Configuration Table**: The standard 15-case topology is expanded to 24 configurations to resolve ambiguities at saddle points that cause voids [S2, abstract only, unofficial]. The specific triangulation rules for these 24 cases are not detailed in the sources, but the existence of this expanded set is the primary structural change [S2, abstract only, unofficial].
-2.  **Smoothing/Distortion Coefficient ($\alpha$)**: A scalar parameter in the range $[0, 1]$ controlling the interpolation behavior [S1].
